POST {{tlsSelfSignedUrl}}/echo

::: body json
{ "over": "tls" }

::: post
test("a body over a retried handshake", () => {
  expect(res.json().scheme).toBe("https");
  expect(res.json().json).toEqual({ over: "tls" });
});

::: docs
The certificate error aborts the handshake before any byte of the request is written, so retrying a POST is safe.
